// ============================================================
//  Extracted data tables (see js/bootstrap/load-order.json for order):
//    BEFORE game.js → PORTRAITS, AILMENTS, BIOMES
//    AFTER  game.js → ENEMIES (uses makeEnemy), UPGRADE_CARDS_REWORK
